category: Libs
requires: cygwin
sdesc: "C and C++ client library for memcached (runtime / hashkit)"
ldesc: "libmemcached-awesome is an open source C/C++ client library and tools for the
memcached server (https://memcached.org/). It has been designed to be light on
memory usage, thread safe, and provide full access to server side methods."
external-source: libmemcached

